    <baseline year="2020">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">Draft legal or institutional arrangements for climate change adaptation at national level exists including; National Climate change policy, Environmental management bill, Environmental management policy , Inactive Inter-ministerial coordination working group without TOR, Climate change policy recommends establishment of Two Tiers of coordination (1. National climate change committee &amp; 2. State committee on climate change) , 30 students graduated from LCDF sponsored MSc. Scholarship now working with government institutions at different levels.</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Institutional review and CCA framework developed for federal Government of Somalia
2. Establishment of steering committee for GCF NAP SP, participated by Federal, state, NGOs, cos and private sectors
3. Technical review of federal systems completed</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Achieved (Institutional review report available with the federal Ministry of Environment and Climate Change
2. Achieved (Steering committee Tor and Meeting minutes approved)
3. Achieved (Technical review report for Federal government on CCA validated and available with the federal Ministry of Environment and Climate Change)</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Conduct an institutional review for the relevant mandated institutions at federal and federal member states 
2. Establishment of national climate change adaptation committee with defined terms of references
3. Hold at least two project Board Meeting</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. An international consultant hired to undertake holistic institutional review at federal and federal member states mandated institutions 
2. Establishment of national climate change adaptation committee is being finalised 
3. one project board meeting held in February 2021 and the other planned in December 2021</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2020-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establish national climate change adaptation framework</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. On 22 September 2020 in Mogadishu, 24 stakeholders from the Federal Republic of Somalia convened for their first National Adaptation Plan (NAP) inception workshop to discuss how the programme will be implemented over the next 36 months (2020-2023
2. Revised Annual Workplan and Baselines available with Directorate of Environment and Climate Change, Office of the Prime Minister . This will be presented to the Project Board in Mid December 2020 for approval. .</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
